{"book":"isaiah","num":57,"verses":[{"en":"The righteous perisheth, and no man layeth it to heart: and merciful men are taken away, none considering that the righteous is taken away from the evil to come.","n":1,"sm":"Ua fano le ua amiotonu, a e leai se mafaufau i ai; ua aveeseina foi tagata alolofa, a ua leai së manatunatu ua aveeseina le ua amiotonu ai le leaga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fano"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"amiotonu,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mafaufau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ai;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"aveeseina"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"alolofa,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"leai"},{"en":"","sm":"së"},{"en":"","sm":"manatunatu"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"aveeseina"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"amiotonu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga."}]},{"en":"He shall enter into peace: they shall rest in their beds, each one walking in his uprightness.","n":2,"sm":"E ulu atu o ia i le manuia, latou te malolo i o latou moega, o i latou ia o e savavali ma le tonu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"ulu"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"manuia,"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"malolo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"moega,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"savavali"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tonu."}]},{"en":"But draw near hither, ye sons of the sorceress, the seed of the adulterer and the whore.","n":3,"sm":"A o outou, ina faalatalata mai ia iinei, o outou tama a le fafine iite i ao, o le fanau a le mulilua ma le fafi